        <item>First release.</item>
        <item>Pomodoro timer with focus, short break and long break every N Pomodoros. Every duration is configurable.</item>
        <item>One-cell home screen widget: tap to start or pause, double-tap to reset.</item>
        <item>Statistics: completed Pomodoros, time focused, day streak, monthly map and 30-day trend.</item>
        <item>End-of-interval alert with a sound of your choice and vibration for as long as you want.</item>
        <item>Spanish and English.</item>
